{"item_uid": "指考96-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有位日本高級官員說：「為了讓本島人與內地人無所差異，又有必要在實質上體認皇道之精神，\n對事物的看法也必須與內地人相同。若語言、姓名、風俗、習慣等，也能與內地人無所差異，\n則是最理想的事。」上述談話最可能出自何人之口？", "options": {"A": "1895年日本內閣總理伊藤博文", "B": "1895年的台灣總督樺山資紀", "C": "1898年的台灣總督兒玉源太郎", "D": "1919年的台灣總督田健治郎"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 53.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 90.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 76.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 80.0, 56.0, 27.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某書描述：「各國的作家和思想家在這裡均可受到熱烈招待。這裡出現了一些由豔光四射且博\n學多才的名媛主持的聚會，作家、學者們可以海闊天空地談論各種問題，參與者常因其口才和\n機智而聲名大噪。」這種情景最可能出現在何時何地？", "options": {"A": "古典希臘時代的雅典", "B": "文藝復興時期的米蘭", "C": "宗教改革時期的倫敦", "D": "啟蒙運動時期的巴黎"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 68.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 90.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 43.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 82.0, 69.0, 57.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "「如果上帝啟示獲利的機會，則選民必須遵循上帝的召命而用心追求。人雖然不可為私利而致\n富，但是可以為上帝勞動而致富。」這最可能是下列哪一種人的經濟觀念？", "options": {"A": "隨商船到亞洲的耶穌會士", "B": "信奉伊斯蘭教的西域商人", "C": "源自喀爾文教派的清教徒", "D": "掌控東南亞金融業的華人"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 63.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 89.0, 74.0, 51.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位史家討論英國婦女地位的變化說：「政府部門急遽膨脹與男子短缺，使婦女的社會、經濟\n力量突然獲得進展。婦女就業人數從217萬人成長到297萬人，增加了80萬人。過去，她們充當\n女侍，或待在父母身邊，或依附丈夫；現在，她們離家工作，甚至遠離家鄉，取得獨立的社會\n地位。」這是描述何時的情況？", "options": {"A": "北美洲獨立戰爭期間", "B": "第一次世界大戰期間", "C": "世界經濟大恐慌期間", "D": "波斯灣戰爭危機期間\n- 1 -\n96年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 96.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 60.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 93.0, 87.0, 77.0, 51.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1860年代以後，台灣政治經濟重心逐漸由南部轉移至北部，其主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "南部米糖生產下降，經濟蕭條，造成人口往北移動", "B": "南部多颱風與地層下陷，天災頻傳，迫使人口外移", "C": "北部移民來源複雜，經常發生變亂，必須駐兵鎮壓", "D": "北部發展茶與樟腦，山區大舉開發，經濟發展快速"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 96.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 100.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 90.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 96.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 90.0, "discrimination": 10.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 99.0, 97.0, 85.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "歷史家評論某一政權，指出：「他的帝國實為新、舊秩序的混合。一方面，他改變國家的社會\n與經濟結構，保留象徵自由、平等、博愛的三色旗，是新秩序的保衛者；另一方面，他雖號稱\n革命之子，實為開明專制的精神後裔，忽略主權在民而行絕對君權，強調平等而不重視自由，\n注重秩序與階級。」評論中的「他」是指何人？", "options": {"A": "建立法蘭西帝國的拿破崙", "B": "成立清教政權的克倫威爾", "C": "背叛民國而稱帝的袁世凱", "D": "二戰之前土耳其的凱末爾"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 88.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 98.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 72.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 72.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 97.0, 94.0, 87.0, 64.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "報紙報導某次大選是：「一場富有歷史意義的選舉，投票所外排隊的人潮長達一哩。1600萬黑\n人與950萬白人、亞裔人和其他有色人種，都出來行使公民權。」認為：「在這塊長期遭受種族\n迫害的土地上，這場選舉象徵民主的誕生，也象徵一個英雄為了對抗種族隔離所作的長期奮\n鬥。」這篇報導中的「選舉」與「英雄」所指各為何？", "options": {"A": "1860年的美國大選；林肯", "B": "1960年的美國大選；金恩", "C": "1962年的古巴大選；卡斯楚", "D": "1995年的南非大選；曼德拉"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 19.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 49.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 78.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 36.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 56.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 63.0, 47.0, 32.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "官員質問某人：「這些是你的書嗎？你會撤銷你的主張嗎？」這人堅持：「我只接受《聖經》的\n權威和自己良心的約束；我不能撤回我寫的任何東西，因為我的良心是跟隨著《聖經》的，而\n昧著良心做事既不穩妥，也不正確。」這應是下列哪兩造的對話？", "options": {"A": "馬丁路德與羅馬教廷的官員", "B": "伽利略與異端裁判所的法官", "C": "耶穌與巴勒斯坦的羅馬總督", "D": "蘇格拉底與雅典的大陪審團"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 60.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 69.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 49.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 65.0, 62.0, 57.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有一國家的統治者實施開明專制，積極支持地主階級，使他們成為國家的中堅；選拔優秀人才\n進入政府服務，形成有效率的文官集團。國家又建立強大的軍隊，逐漸發展成為強權。這個國\n家應是：", "options": {"A": "彼得大帝時的俄羅斯", "B": "明治維新以後的日本", "C": "統一德意志的普魯士", "D": "加富爾主政的義大利"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 31.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 45.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 19.0, "p_value": 27.0, "p_high": 31.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [36.0, 25.0, 23.0, 25.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有一個文學派別，不再強調感情與辭藻，而著眼於描繪具體的事實，並將科學的原理應用在社\n會現實的分析上。這個文學派別應為何？", "options": {"A": "十八世紀後期的古典主義", "B": "十九世紀前期的浪漫主義", "C": "十九世紀後期的寫實主義", "D": "二十世紀中葉的存在主義"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 82.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 82.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 89.0, 86.0, 79.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "根據右圖這幅標題為「英格蘭白人奴工」的版畫內容推測，「英格蘭\n白人奴工」所指應為何？", "options": {"A": "美國獨立戰爭時，被強制勞動的英軍俘虜", "B": "十八世紀初期，流放到澳洲勞工營的罪犯", "C": "十八世紀後期，英國工廠僱用的童工女工", "D": "二次大戰期間，納粹集中營裡的英國戰俘\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 96年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 45.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 76.0, 66.0, 55.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某篇論文指出：一位君主因為信佛者甚眾，影響國計民生，所以強迫僧侶還俗，甚至徵調為兵；\n又沒收寺產，充為國用，因此「租調年增，兵師日盛」。這篇論文最可能的主題應是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "佛教的傳播", "B": "寺院與經濟", "C": "稅制的變革", "D": "兵制與國防"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 54.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 86.0, 73.0, 55.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "史書描述某一民族因人口過剩而向外殖民，指出：這一個民族移殖所到之處，其制度、宗教和\n生活方式亦隨之而至。他們比照自己的母邦，建立獨立自主的城邦。新殖民城邦隨即發展與母\n邦相似的經濟生活，產生與母邦相似的社會、政治紛爭。這一個民族應是：", "options": {"A": "西元前七世紀向外移民的希臘人", "B": "十七世紀中移往美洲的英國清教徒", "C": "十九世紀初移民東南亞的中國人", "D": "二十世紀中移民巴勒斯坦的猶太人"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 31.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 45.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 45.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 33.0, 28.0, 23.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "漢初一位學者稱許某學派「序君臣上下」的論點，認為有助於政治秩序的建立，但也批評這個\n學派「內容廣博，卻不易掌握其要點；學習者雖花力氣，獲得的成效卻很少。」這個學派最可\n能是指：", "options": {"A": "儒家", "B": "道家", "C": "墨家", "D": "法家"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 66.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 86.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 81.0, 71.0, 59.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位生長於魚米之鄉的湖湘子弟，在家書中提到軍旅生活說：駐地「風沙漫天，冰雪載地，石\n田千里」，因此軍隊必須修築道路，以運載軍需，並在沿途栽植楊柳，以防風沙。這種情況與\n下列哪一事件有關？", "options": {"A": "成吉思汗西征", "B": "明軍攻打蒙古", "C": "清軍平定新疆", "D": "共軍抗美援朝"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 53.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 14.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 62.0, 53.0, 42.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某一部族領袖感嘆：從祖先遷居中國境內之後，常受漢人欺凌，雖有王侯名號，卻無實際的領\n土，與平民無異。他因此鼓動分散於中國境內的部落反抗朝廷，並建立了政權。此部族應為：", "options": {"A": "匈奴", "B": "契丹", "C": "蒙古", "D": "女真"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 46.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 22.0, "p_value": 22.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 8.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 26.0, 13.0, 7.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "資料一：法律規定，夫妻口角後，妻上吊自殺，丈夫不受處分。如果是夫因此上吊自殺，妻要\n被判處「絞刑」。\n資料二：一對夫妻爭吵互毆，丈夫氣不過上吊自殺。地方官原來判處妻子「絞刑」，但後來皇\n帝指示：「婦之於夫，猶臣之於君，子之於父，同列三綱，所關綦重。」便改判「斬\n立決」（即時執行斬首）。\n從這兩則資料判斷，下列哪一項敘述是正確的？", "options": {"A": "中國傳統社會具有法律之前人人平等的特色", "B": "皇帝尊重官員的判決，也遵照法律規定判刑", "C": "皇帝改判更嚴厲的處分，是為了維護綱常名教", "D": "皇帝任意破壞法律，使法律喪失維護綱常名教的功能"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 80.0, 71.0, 61.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "長江三角洲自中唐以後農業發達，一向是糧食輸出區；但明末以來，卻需仰賴外地輸入糧食。\n這種現象與下列何者最有關？", "options": {"A": "改種經濟作物，造成糧作不足", "B": "戰亂頻仍，農業生產遭到破壞", "C": "水利失修，造成糧食生產減少", "D": "新作物傳入，飲食習慣漸改變"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 50.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 79.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 66.0, 47.0, 33.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位臺灣士紳為慶祝戰爭結束，寫了一副對聯：「四百餘里鯤鯓已去復返；五十一年婢僕垂死\n重生。」這位士紳要慶祝的是哪一事件？", "options": {"A": "台灣民主國成立之際，慶祝台灣脫離清朝統治", "B": "日俄戰爭中，日本戰勝了俄國，成為亞洲強權", "C": "一次世界大戰，日本戰勝，一躍成為世界強權", "D": "二次世界大戰，日本戰敗，臺灣回歸中華民國\n- 3 -\n96年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 93.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 100.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 81.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 93.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 81.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 98.0, 94.0, 74.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "宋代城市的規模、機能與城市生活型態，有延續前代而發展，也有因應新情勢而變革。下列選\n項中，何者為宋代明顯不同於唐代的新發展？", "options": {"A": "城市商業繁榮，商幫勢力興起", "B": "官府維持夜禁，但准許延長營業時間", "C": "茶館酒樓林立，說書、演戲等娛樂盛行", "D": "士大夫與庶民生活方式差異日趨擴大"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 77.0, 66.0, 55.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "周代宗法制度是國家權力繼承和分配的重要基礎，強調「親親」、「尊祖」與「敬宗」，希望凝\n聚國族成員的力量。但宗法制度發展到一定程度，也可能無法繼續維持封建秩序。下列哪一現\n象可以說明這種變化？", "options": {"A": "宗廟祭祀活動頻繁，規模日大，導致民窮財困", "B": "邦國各自發展，親戚關係日遠，甚至相互兼併", "C": "強宗大族壟斷土地，使政府無法獲得足夠稅收", "D": "公卿大夫世襲，握有政權，促使官僚體制發展"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 54.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 86.0, 73.0, 56.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位地方官員約束粵莊人民，不准參與漳、泉械鬥，並要求他們自備武器糧食，操演軍備，以\n防守粵莊。這最可能是台灣何時的情況？", "options": {"A": "鄭氏時期", "B": "清領前期", "C": "清領後期", "D": "日治初期"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 58.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 79.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 70.0, 57.0, 45.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "中國有一宗教，淵源於古代巫祝的傳統與方術中追求長生的思想；因天災疾疫流行，社會動亂\n頻仍，信徒日眾；後來受到其他宗教的影響，也編纂經典、強化教義及組織，影響漸廣。這是\n指哪一宗教？", "options": {"A": "道教", "B": "佛教", "C": "禪宗", "D": "白蓮教"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 79.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 55.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 55.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 86.0, 74.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某人宣示：你們要遵守我的誡命，不可與你們要去的那地方的居民妥協。相反的，你們要摧毀\n他們的祭壇，砍倒他們的神柱和神像。這段敘述應來自下列何者？", "options": {"A": "摩西率人出埃及時的聲明", "B": "周公東征時對軍隊的誓詞", "C": "墾首對移民台灣者的說法", "D": "拿破崙率兵征俄時的宣傳"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 42.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 56.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 23.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 56.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [61.0, 46.0, 40.0, 35.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "歷史上某一時代農民的處境為：必須負擔力役和實物租稅，不能任意遷徙或從事其他行業。耕\n種時由地主提供農具、種子、牲畜，農民無法自行決定作物種類，也不得任意在地主的池塘中\n捕魚、森林中打獵。這是何時何地的情況？", "options": {"A": "二世紀初的雅典", "B": "十一世紀的法國", "C": "十六世紀的華北", "D": "十八世紀的台灣"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 63.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 89.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 81.0, 67.0, 50.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
